diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index ca3ce12..78276c6 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -1,5 +1,15 @@
 # Changelog
 
+## 1.0.6
+
+- Added live Foreman job-template input-contract validation using `/api/templates/:id/template_inputs`.
+- Schema defaults are defensively re-applied when mapped form values are missing or blank, preventing empty Foreman inputs from overriding meaningful Chiklet/Ansible defaults.
+- Requests are pre-flighted against the live Foreman template before entering approval by default (`FOREMAN_PREFLIGHT_INPUTS_ON_SUBMIT=true`).
+- Workers repeat the input-contract check immediately before job creation so template changes after approval fail closed without launching Ansible.
+- Mapped Foreman input names that do not exist on the template are rejected with a clear configuration error.
+- Unmapped Foreman inputs with blank/required defaults are rejected unless explicitly acknowledged with `foreman.allow_unmapped_inputs`.
+- Deterministic input-contract errors no longer consume Celery retries and are audited as `FOREMAN_INPUT_CONTRACT_FAILED`.
+
 ## 1.0.5
 
 - Made the Chiklet JSON Schema the authoritative source for end-user deployment customisation.
